# Root-anchored ON PURPOSE. This was an unanchored `build/` from the GSD
# baseline, which matches a directory named "build" at ANY depth — and that
# silently excluded app/app/build/, the entire parametric home-builder route.
# The page worked locally and would simply never have reached the repo.
# If a compiled-output directory ever appears deeper in the tree, ignore it by
# its own path rather than by re-broadening this one.
